  <wpt lat="54.464701" lon="-3.012414"><name>#1 By Forestside Plantation</name><desc>Score 98. gaps between trees or buildings to fly through; tree lines and edges to skim along; lone trees or pillars to orbit and power-loop. Partly A3-clear (70%). Keep the 5" in the clear part; the grey overlay shows where it isn't. The rest is fine for a sub-250 g drone under A1. Warnings: Nature reserve or SSSI: byelaws often ban drones; watch for nesting birds</desc><sym>Flag</sym></wpt>
